     7.3       : AquaCrop Version
    100         : percentage (%) of ground surface covered by mulches BEFORE growing period
    100         : percentage (%) of ground surface covered by mulches AFTER growing period
    50         : effect (%) of mulches on reduction of soil evaporation
     0         : number of irrigation events BEFORE growing period
     0.0       : quality of irrigation water BEFORE growing period (dS/m)
     0         : number of irrigation events AFTER growing period
     0.0       : quality of irrigation water AFTER growing period (dS/m)
    100         : percentage (%) of soil surface wetted by off-season irrigation
